h Co. is 15 August, not what I posted earlier. Their ops lead corrected me.\n```","id":4,"source":"marcus-lindqvist, #north-random, 2026-10-14T12:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 6; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #north-random on 2026-10-14 12:00: I replied to Marcus in a thread on his message in #north-random. I confirmed the correction: the signed order form for Thornbury Cloth Co. is due 15 August. I also pointed out that 15 August has already passed, since today is 14 October, and asked him to tell me if Thornbury's ops lead meant a different month or next year.\n\nI took no other action, as he asked. I didn't look up the date he posted earlier, so I can't say what it was.\n```","id":6,"source":"assistant, #north-random, 2026-10-14T12:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 9; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #north-team on 2026-10-16 00:00: I replied to Marcus in a thread on his #north-team message: \"Thanks Marcus, noted: the signed order form deadline for Brackenwater Freight Co. is 26 November.\"\n\nHe said no action was needed, so I didn't do anything else. That reply is the only record of the date. I didn't save it to the knowledge brain myself, since it saves channel messages on its own.\n```","id":9,"source":"assistant, #north-team, 2026-10-16T00:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"ilse-varga"}
